        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOEDN, Eden Prairie Egg Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor a traditional look with character, the Georgetown Eden Prairie Knob's egg shape is perfect. A prime example of traditional decor that still has a fitting place among today's world, this knobset features the egg knob and stepped rose that gives it a classic appeal that goes beyond the normal round knob. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOEDN Georgetown Eden Prairie Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Eden Prairie Egg Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GEOEDN-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262181\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GEOEDN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Georgetown Eden Prairie Knob",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOEDN Eden Prairie Egg Knob - For a traditional look with character, the Georgetown Eden Prairie Knob's egg shape is perfect. A prime example of traditional decor that still has a fitting place among today's world, this knobset features the egg knob and stepped rose that gives it a classic appeal that goes beyond the normal round knob. It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Eden Prairie Egg Knobs, Georgetown Eden Prairie Knobs, GRA-GEOEDN, Grandeur GEOEDN, egg knobsets, Eden Prairie Knob with Georgetown rosettes, classic knobs, egg knobs, Grandeur Georgetown series,"
